# Netlify redirect rules for Paddock (Vite SPA with prerendering)
#
# All known routes have their own prerendered index.html files in dist/.
# Netlify serves those directly with a 200 — no redirect needed for those paths.
#
# This catch-all serves the root index.html (with a 200, not a redirect) for
# any path that does NOT have a prerendered file, so client-side routing
# handles it cleanly instead of returning a 404.

/*    /index.html    200
